{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前Cookies成員鄧麗欣（Stephy）今年年初勇奪「叱咤樂壇我最喜愛的女歌手」，歌唱事業再創高峰，人氣強勁！日前鄧麗欣獲邀擔任表演嘉賓，以一身白色連身褲上陣的她，大騷白滑玉背，相當吸睛！</p><figure><img alt=\"叱咤樂壇我最喜愛的女歌手！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072590984220672182359.jpeg/pEF4zgtsaNkameIB7-PmZUlYsrDA__DV1dypMdXcqTE\"/><figcaption>叱咤樂壇我最喜愛的女歌手！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好靚！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072588618502144548019.jpeg/X-WbrPxUtkfjTEFuXIQ9fy0qMrrf29VynWVV3p1lVd4\"/><figcaption>好靚！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好靚！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072586244395008186750.jpeg/1tEL2NnRsro8gxK-pkDTEaaubFkCktM-yBZM9sgWTPY\"/><figcaption>好靚！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大露背！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072583606046720706813.jpeg/_9QxI6kDDlrXFL93qWs1G_eqP_V8x2maxKNBEMSjQRA\"/><figcaption>大露背！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大露背！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072862590308352165208.jpeg/uSW50sqBJYZkNuPRJRcbs4J_FD6P1bZsk494_5OPeP8\"/><figcaption>大露背！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大露背！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140073117440282624095438.jpeg/1JSWPchwxK27Jy_10Ye1fLVxiAFeCG6xAhUwGgIVMBo\"/><figcaption>大露背！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大露背！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072859368951808527639.jpeg/NiQGcMc4FgD-KxWjgferZFecd4WrhPf83SpU8t0qVPI\"/><figcaption>大露背！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure><p>鄧麗欣大露背戰衣亮相　帶病獻唱無損表現</p><p>有網民上載了鄧麗欣在台上獻唱的片段，當日她唱了《不要離我太遠》及「跑Online」主題曲《Fantasy Tale》，現場觀眾反應相當熱烈，除了掀起大合唱之外，鄧麗欣更同觀眾握手打招呼，完全零架子！不過原來鄧麗欣近日身體抱恙，她在IG分享當日的造型靚相，並寫道：「記得上年差不多這個月份又係開始咳，之後仲失埋聲🫣今年差唔多呢個時候，我又咳喇🫠唔知係咪因為天氣太熱又吹冷氣啦，總之大家都要小心身體💪🏻」但完全無影響她的表現，狀態大勇！</p><figure><img alt=\"鄧麗欣獲邀擔任表演嘉賓。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072998993399808964107.jpeg/B_ubhe_z0NWD_3ABemf5HuG3Fha779d_ydxGKsncRio\"/><figcaption>鄧麗欣獲邀擔任表演嘉賓。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"獻唱。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072996032090112832451.jpeg/4RTPdSQpAIPmsdgnnMVcMJBVf0iiNN0JN3A71DdwO9Q\"/><figcaption>獻唱。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《不要離我太遠》（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072993649594368342508.jpeg/iZXIClsDnIe4V_BGJFQ91vvhAeWwSft4ILNdAiCzXQI\"/><figcaption>《不要離我太遠》（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《不要離我太遠》（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140073003204743168039647.jpeg/ODaYE6ZQIaI2GEn23KbU-47hZRPKbBOs_LEY2PyxGNg\"/><figcaption>《不要離我太遠》（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反應熱烈！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140073001048739840035841.jpeg/4mLlO83zFDFuGjjSIDSvWVgJQ6XHZ35UcMoOTXDKDk0\"/><figcaption>反應熱烈！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反應熱烈！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072998716575744031764.jpeg/wEBjmnl7loLOrQKBj_w2ESgX6z2vkuVAl3PILZdzyC0\"/><figcaption>反應熱烈！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反應熱烈！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072995994341376325691.jpeg/T1s40Hi0lyl6mAhHE77Jo-cPbk_SCokAriaW064mltM\"/><figcaption>反應熱烈！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Fit！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140072993746063360724906.jpeg/CyLtvDPH0ar_HJEszZN4rz55JWVavmf7KSMkZykjJGc\"/><figcaption>Fit！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態大勇！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140073124050767872834519.jpeg/doOGwlVdzf6pczVGDC6GAI7jhXl-T4ucQPnQf0D50H8\"/><figcaption>狀態大勇！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀態大勇！（IG@stboo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1140073120586141696529681.jpeg/X5NOm-5H2I6oiKH5Ve6XPy0Hb9vUQlnVqbm36qm5t-o\"/><figcaption>狀態大勇！（IG@stboo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-06T16:31:55.766925+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":582,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}